  "qualification": "Author working-tree development RED/GREEN, not immutable intermediate source snapshots. Initial variant test used an incorrect TrainingTask.episode.x access that was corrected to public inputs before first implementation run; initial RED was the missing pipeline API. The initial 18-case targeted run preceded the summed trace-buffer reserve correction; the final 9-case unit run includes that correction. Nine saved workflows passed before that accounting-only correction; final repository checks are separate. Static failures and repairs are retained where logged. Complete intermediate source snapshots NOT_RETAINED."
